From 0386456bd431f3ae7a9ee37361ba3c2a375be58c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Karthikeyan K <karthikk@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 03 Feb 2022 08:09:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-68803] arcboot: bringup logic for gaudi3

The pcie bringup images logic is added for gaudi3. Major changes
compared to gaudi2:

1) Use image pointer framework to read and process the ppboot image
parameters.

2) Adapt individual sub-routines to increase re-usability in ppboot.

Change-Id: Ic33b88cfbf381ce58deb3b4142ce3f7fdb1b075a
---

